WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 10 — English subtitles — the ACTUAL spoken dialogue, transcribed from the video audio (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-23 from the real episode audio (whisper-tiny + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:11.300
What is that key?

2
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.300
This is it. This is Mother's Key.

3
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.300
The one to her locked drawer.

4
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.300
Why do you have it, Omar?

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.830
I... I found it among her things.

6
00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:26.420
It's not what you think.

7
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.420
You had the key all along for 30 years.

8
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:45.410
It's open.

9
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:49.410
My mother gave me the key the night before she passed away with one instruction.

10
00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:53.410
My mother's instruction was to lock it away and never tell anyone.

11
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:56.410
Inside the drawer's hidden back panel,

12
00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.410
there's an old phone with a label in her handwriting.
